      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nVIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE BY REQUEST\n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Gleeson are delighted to present No. 17 Willowmere Drive to the market, a spacious 4-Bedroom detached residence situated in this mature and well-established residential development in Thurles.\n\nExtending to approximately 118 sq.m. / 1,272 sq.ft., the property offers generous accommodation over two floors, with a particularly spacious open-plan Kitchen / Dining / Living Room, four Bedrooms and excellent natural light throughout. Externally, No. 17 benefits from gardens to the front and rear, private off-street parking and a detached Garage.\n\nWell maintained throughout, this property presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in a convenient location, within easy reach of Thurles town centre and its extensive range of amenities.\n\nLOCATION\n\nWillowmere Drive is a mature residential development conveniently situated on the outskirts of Thurles, yet within easy reach of the town centre.\n\nThurles offers an excellent range of amenities including shops, supermarkets, cafés and restaurants, together with primary, secondary and third-level educational facilities. The town is renowned as the home of the GAA and provides an extensive range of sporting and recreational amenities, including Semple Stadium, Thurles Golf Club, local sports clubs and leisure facilities.\n\nThurles Train Station provides regular mainline services to Dublin, Cork and Limerick, while the M8 DublinCork Motorway is also readily accessible via the Horse & Jockey interchange.\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\nThe accommodation is well proportioned throughout, beginning with a covered Entrance Porch opening to the Entrance Hall.\n\nTo the front is a spacious Sitting Room with a large window providing excellent natural light and a feature fireplace forming the focal point of the room.\n\nTo the rear is an impressive open-plan Kitchen / Dining / Living Room, extending to over 8 metres in length and providing an excellent everyday family space. The Kitchen is fitted with an extensive range of units and generous worktop space, while the adjoining Dining / Living area offers ample room for both dining and additional seating. Large windows provide plenty of natural light, with a door giving direct access to the rear garden.\n\nA generously sized Guest W.C. with W.H.B. completes the ground-floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, a central Landing serves four Bedrooms, together with the main Family Bathroom. The bedrooms are well proportioned and benefit from good natural light, with built-in storage provided to a number of rooms. The fourth bedroom also lends itself particularly well to use as a home office or study if required.\n\nThe Family Bathroom is fully tiled and fitted with bath with electric shower over, W.C. and W.H.B.\n\nOutside, a private driveway provides off-street parking and extends along the side of the house to a detached Garage, offering useful additional storage or workshop space.\n\nThe front garden is laid mainly in lawn with mature hedging providing good screening from the road, while to the rear is an enclosed lawned garden with established shrubs and planting, offering a pleasant and practical outdoor space.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nGround Floor: Entrance Porch, Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen / Dining / Living Room and Guest W.C. with W.H.B.\n\nFirst Floor: Landing, 4 Bedrooms and Family Bathroom.\n\nTotal Floor Area: Approx. 118.1 sq.m. / 1,272 sq.ft.\n\nOverall, No. 17 Willowmere Drive offers an excellent combination of space, convenience and potential in a mature residential setting. With four bedrooms, generous living accommodation, private gardens, off-street parking and a detached garage, this property is ideally suited to families, first-time buyers seeking a long-term home, or those wishing to put their own stamp on a substantial detached residence close to Thurles town centre.\n\nA virtual tour link can be supplied on request with in-person viewings strictly by appointment. Further enquiries can be made through the Sole Selling Agents, Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson in Thurles (0504) 22997.\n____________________________________\n\nNote: These particulars are issued by Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson on the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract and are provided for guidance purposes only. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, no liability is accepted for any errors or omissions. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information provided, through inspection or other means. The vendor does not make or give, and neither Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson nor any of its employees has authority to make or give, any representation or warranty in respect of this property. Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson is marketing this property on the basis that all relevant title and certification documents are in place or will be provided by the vendor prior to sale.\n____________________________________"
      },
